        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Discovered on the set of Salut Bonjour! where he impressed Gino Chouinard and the whole of Quebec, he now has over 25 million views on social networks. A finalist on La France a un incroyable talent, the role of Herbert Léotard in the play Moi ... et l\\'autre and a highly-anticipated first solo show...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
